WEBVTT

00:10:27.755 --> 00:10:30.840
it has to vanish when the helium
atoms touch each other.

00:10:30.864 --> 00:10:33.173
The other fact
is that in the ground state --

00:10:33.197 --> 00:10:35.934
the lowest energy state
of a quantum system --

00:10:35.958 --> 00:10:39.229
the wave function is always very smooth;

00:10:39.253 --> 00:10:41.348
it has the minimum number of wiggles.

00:10:41.372 --> 00:10:42.900
So he sat down --

00:10:42.924 --> 00:10:45.195
and I imagine he had nothing more

00:10:45.219 --> 00:10:47.632
than a simple piece
of paper and a pencil --

00:10:47.656 --> 00:10:49.896
and he tried to write down,
and did write down,

00:10:49.920 --> 00:10:52.215
the simplest function
that he could think of,

00:10:52.239 --> 00:10:54.216
which had the boundary conditions

00:10:54.240 --> 00:10:56.704
that the wave function
vanish when things touch

00:10:56.728 --> 00:10:58.441
and is smooth in between.

00:10:59.233 --> 00:11:01.972
He wrote down a simple thing --
so simple, in fact,